===== PHASE D — which classes were actually observed =====
H-host-identity
V-live-figure
PASS coverage/V-live-figure-observed (1)
PASS coverage/H-host-identity-observed (1)
Both classes were observed, but only at a FEW of their allowed positions,
and the comparisons above name exactly which. Class V differed only at the
wall-clock date line, because these runs are minutes apart and no registry
or GitHub counter moved inside that window; a rerun days later will differ
at more of its 126 allowed positions, and the rule admits that. Class H
differed only where run 3's environment differs from this host's ambient
one. The remaining allowed positions of each class are exercised by the
synthetic in-position control in phase H2, not by these runs.

