===== PHASE F — the mechanism: the two pipelines, with and without the fix =====
The two regions revision 2 got wrong are the only sort-ordered output in
the check. Run each pipeline UNFIXED under two locales, from run 1's
unpacked artifacts, and the orders differ; run it with LC_ALL=C pinned, as
revision 3's check does, and they agree.
